      "notes": [
        "CAM_ENABLE enables digital I/O first. CAM_ANALOG_ENABLE then enables analog and VCM and the DVP buffers.",
        "With default PWDN high and RESET low: enable 1.8 V, wait for settling, enable 2.8 V, then wait at least 5 ms.",
        "Start XCLK, deassert PWDN, wait at least 1 ms, release RESET, then wait at least 20 ms before SCCB at 0x3C.",
        "Shut down with PWDN high, RESET low, XCLK off, 2.8 V off and discharged, then switch off 1.8 V."
